<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-2130] UI use the default ZEPPELIN_PORT to open web socket</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2130</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;After changing the default value for the parameter ZEPPELIN_PORT, the web page try to open the ws on the default port 8080 without success because there isn&apos;t nothing in listen on this port. I tried to use the property zeppelin.websocket.port of older version but that does not fix the issue.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
